1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,833
In January eighteen sixty-three,

2
00:00:02,833 --> 00:00:04,933
during the American Civil War,

3
00:00:04,933 --> 00:00:09,000
Thomas Nast drew Santa Claus
for Harper's Weekly.

4
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:11,700
His Santa visited
a Union army camp,

5
00:00:11,700 --> 00:00:14,833
in a coat of stars
and striped trousers.

6
00:00:14,833 --> 00:00:17,033
It was printed
in black and white.
